=== layout: one-panel

# Ways to Contact Dr. Voss

@body

- [Discord]{color=red}: use the class channel for general questions or a direct message for private matters.
- [Office hours]{color=green}: ask questions in person or over Zoom.
- [Email]{color=blue}: nvoss@roosevelt.edu. I read email within 24 hours and respond within two business days.
- Send a follow-up if I have not responded within that time.
- Please use institutional email for course matters rather than my Gmail account.

